 python3-platformdirs (>= 2.0),
 python3-pyqt5 | python3-pyqt6 | python3-pyside6
Description: DNA fragment analysis tool
 CE-machine-independent tool for fragment analysis data processing.
 Supports baseline correction and denoising, selective channel hiding,
 peak detection and sizing, allele binning using GeneMapper,
 GeneMarker and NCBI OSIRIS panels, stutter alleles filtering, and CSV
 or CODIS 3.2 CMF XML export.
